DELTAAM =            0.0556561 / Average of (std-obj) airmass                   TELMETH = 'Deconvolution'      / Telluric correction method                     VEGADV  =              48.5911 / Vega velocity shift (km s-1)                   TCMAXDEV=              2.29016 / The maxmimum % deviation of Vega-data          TCRMSDEV=              1.24718 / The RMS % deviation of Vega-data               TELFILE = 'nires_J0443-0838_20190214_tellspec.fits' / The telluric correction fiPROGNAME= 'U159    '           / Program Name                                   HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY ######################## Xspextool History ########################     HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY Spextool FITS files contain an array of size                            HISTORY [nwaves,4,norders*naps]. The ith image (array[*,*,i]) contains the      HISTORY data for a single extraction aperture within an order such that,        HISTORY lambda=array[*,0,i], flux=array[*,1,i],                                 HISTORY uncertainty=array[*,2,i],flag=array[*,3,i].  The zeroth image           HISTORY (array[*,*,0]) contains the data for the aperture in the order          HISTORY closest to the bottom of the detector that is closest to the            HISTORY bottom of the slit (i.e. also closest to the bottom of the              HISTORY detector).  Moving up the detector, the FITS array is filled in         HISTORY with subsequent extraction apertures.  If no orders have been           HISTORY deselected in the extraction process, the contents of the ith           HISTORY aperture in order j can be found as follows:                            HISTORY lambda=array[*,0,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                         HISTORY flux=array[*,1,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                           HISTORY uncertainty=array[*,2,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                    HISTORY flag=array[*,3,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)].                           HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY ######################## Xcombspec History ########################     HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY The spectra in spectra1052.fits, spectra1053.fits,                      HISTORY spectra1054.fits, spectra1055.fits, spectra1056.fits,                   HISTORY spectra1057.fits, spectra1058.fits, spectra1059.fits were combined      HISTORY using a Robust Weighted Mean with a threshold of 8.    Aperture 01      HISTORY Modifications: The scale factors were determined using order 005        HISTORY and are 0.968158, 1.09065, 1.23691, 1.15212, 1.04709, 0.930347,         HISTORY 0.891019, 0.794623.  The spectral shapes have been corrected.           HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY ######################## Xtellcor History #########################     HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY The Vega model was shifted by 48.5911 km s-1.  The maximum              HISTORY deviation and rms deviation between the modified Vega model and         HISTORY the data over the kernel wavelength range are 2.29016% and              HISTORY 1.24718%, respectively.  The telluric correction spectra for            HISTORY aperture 01 were shifted by -0.01, -0.01, +0.47, -0.75 pixels.          HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY ###################### Xmergeorders History #######################     HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY This merged spectrum was derived from the file                          HISTORY nires_J0443-0838_20190214.fits.                                         END                                                                             